# ARM 1 — LDHA-selective metabolic inhibitor candidate set (AGA-RX PATH C)
# Format: SMILES <tab> name <tab> rationale
# All SMILES verified via PubChem (CID in rationale). The LEAD is GSK2837808A,
# a literature LDHA/LDHB dual inhibitor with strong LDHA potency — used here as
# the selectivity anchor; the screen explores scaffolds biased toward the LDHA
# mobile-loop (Arg105) + nicotinamide-adjacent sub-pocket that differs from LDHB.
#
# Selectivity is scored OFF-DECK: dock each row vs BOTH ldha (vina_dock_ldha.conf)
# and ldhb (vina_dock_ldhb.conf); report dG_LDHA, dG_LDHB, and gap=dG_LDHA-dG_LDHB.

